    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismal Dreams is a relentless RPG, where the judgement of daylight is all but gone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/2195ee1f6caa56aff42aa124496cc779.avif?t=1743479498\" width=224 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a troubled <strong>Sammy Fraud</strong> and happy go lucky\u00a0<strong>William Peacher</strong> through an uncaring and hostile world, it may take a few attempts.\u00a0Rummage and explore through what's left of\u00a0civilization in it's thrown together district; the Dam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.poster.avif?t=1743479498\" width=300 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.webm?t=1743479498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.mp4?t=1743479498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make use of anything</strong> you can find to protect yourself, however unusual. Each weapon comes with it's own unique skillset/playstyle, no senseless killing and grinding to unlock new skills. Even something mundane like a mop or a flashlight have their own distinct purpose in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/7235f0db637d0d842799b29c757d01b5.avif?t=1743479498\" width=320 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for anything</strong>, every encounter in the game is unique and presents a different challenge beyond higher stats. No two enemies share the same attack. Pick your battles wisely, you're not a bloodthirsty monster, you're a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismal Dreams is a relentless RPG, where the judgement of daylight is all but gone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/2195ee1f6caa56aff42aa124496cc779.avif?t=1743479498\" width=224 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a troubled <strong>Sammy Fraud</strong> and happy go lucky\u00a0<strong>William Peacher</strong> through an uncaring and hostile world, it may take a few attempts.\u00a0Rummage and explore through what's left of\u00a0civilization in it's thrown together district; the Dam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.poster.avif?t=1743479498\" width=300 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.webm?t=1743479498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/b8fca59fb299a146552112eac0f45223.mp4?t=1743479498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make use of anything</strong> you can find to protect yourself, however unusual. Each weapon comes with it's own unique skillset/playstyle, no senseless killing and grinding to unlock new skills. Even something mundane like a mop or a flashlight have their own distinct purpose in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367930/extras/7235f0db637d0d842799b29c757d01b5.avif?t=1743479498\" width=320 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for anything</strong>, every encounter in the game is unique and presents a different challenge beyond higher stats. No two enemies share the same attack. Pick your battles wisely, you're not a bloodthirsty monster, you're a survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dismal Dreams is a gritty, turn-based RPGmaker game, set in a lightless world. All that's left for you to inherit, is a hellscape without answers.",
